      "factual_description": "Smoke Jazz Club presents Bird Lives! A Charlie Parker Birthday Celebration from Wednesday, August 26 through Sunday, August 30, 2026. The residency is led by Vincent Herring on alto saxophone and Eric Alexander on tenor saxophone, with Mike LeDonne on piano and John Webber on bass. Smoke lists 6:30 PM and 8:30 PM shows throughout the run, with additional 10:00 PM shows on Friday August 28 and Saturday August 29. The venue frames the engagement around Herring and Alexander's long-running two-saxophone collaboration, which includes The Battle: Live at Smoke and the more recent Split Decision. Smoke's currently accessible primary pages conflict on the drummer assignment, listing Lewis Nash on the residency hub and Carl Allen on current show-list/individual pages, so no drummer is asserted in the canonical candidate until the venue resolves that inconsistency.",
